    mz:definedBy "0023-if-workspaces FR-022" ;
    mz:justification "No standard adopted yet. Examined: Git's `git status --porcelain=v2 --branch` reports the branch head, its upstream and the ahead and behind counts, and Git documents locks and a detached HEAD, but Git publishes no vocabulary of states; missing, wrong remote and not a repository are the workspace's. Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005)." ;
    mz:termIri "https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#RepoState" .

