    mz:addedOn "2026-11-17" ;
    mz:basis mz:Unaligned ;
    mz:definedBy "0023-if-workspaces FR-001" ;
    mz:justification "No standard adopted yet. Examined: PROV-O (prov:Entity is too general to carry a root, a layout and a policy), DOAP (describes a project and its repositories, not a local area they are cloned into), the Development Containers specification (workspaceFolder is a setting of a configuration file, not a vocabulary) and the VS Code workspace file (a product format). None defines a managed local workspace. Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005)." ;
    mz:termIri "https://www.intellectualfrontiers.com/ontology/ifws#Workspace" .

